---
---

<section id="setup" class="py-24 px-4 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 section-bg-1 opacity-60"></div>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative z-10 section-in">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">
      <span class="gradient-text">/</span> <span data-i18n="setup.heading">My Setup</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#e94560] mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full"></div>
    <p class="text-subtle text-center mb-12" data-i18n="setup.subtitle">Scripts · Blueprints · Automation</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="stagger-child card-bg rounded-xl p-5 border border-custom hover:border-[#00d9ff]/40 transition-all">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-lg">⚙️</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-primary text-sm" data-i18n="setup.scriptsCardTitle">System Control</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3" data-i18n="setup.scriptsCardDesc">Menú Rofi con 30+ herramientas: gestión de red, bluetooth, audio, power management, screen capture, modo juego, night mode, fixes de XDG Portal y más. Todo desde un solo launcher con íconos Nerd Font y búsqueda fuzzy.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] bg-badge text-[#e94560] rounded font-mono">Bash</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] bg-badge text-[#e94560] rounded font-mono">Rofi</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] bg-badge text-[#e94560] rounded font-mono">Zenity</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stagger-child card-bg rounded-xl p-5 border border-custom hover:border-[#e94560]/40 transition-all">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-lg">🎨</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-primary text-sm" data-i18n="setup.blueprintTitle">Blueprints & Tokens</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3" data-i18n="setup.blueprintDesc">Extractor de design tokens desde imágenes: paletas de colores, CSS custom properties, prompts para IA. Workflow completo para pasar de una referencia visual a código listo para producción.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] bg-badge text-[#e94560] rounded font-mono">Bash</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] bg-badge text-[#e94560] rounded font-mono">CSS</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] bg-badge text-[#e94560] rounded font-mono">AI</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stagger-child card-bg rounded-xl p-5 border border-custom">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-lg">⚡</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-primary text-sm" data-i18n="setup.scriptsTitle">Scripts & Automation</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3" data-i18n="setup.scriptsDesc">50+ scripts propios: save-point system para rollback de config, scrcpy connect, widget launcher, power modes, Omarchy Package Install, LimpiarCache, Gitaliases y más. Automatización total del ecosistema Arch.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] bg-badge text-[#e94560] rounded font-mono">Bash</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] bg-badge text-[#e94560] rounded font-mono">Python</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] bg-badge text-[#e94560] rounded font-mono">Zsh</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stagger-child card-bg rounded-xl p-5 border border-custom">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="text-lg">🎨</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-primary text-sm" data-i18n="setup.galleryTitle">Galería del Setup</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3" data-i18n="setup.galleryDesc">Screenshots del desktop: Waybar con widgets EWW, Rofi System Control, Wofi Clipboard, Fastfetch, y el ecosistema visual completo.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/dizzi1222/dotfiles-dizzi" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-[#00d9ff] hover:underline">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.604-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"/></svg>
          <span data-i18n="setup.galleryCta">Ver repositorio de dotfiles →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
